 169: - Cassini rescaling: \path{native-final-closure-manifest.json}
 170: - corrections, mass normalization and history: \path{native-closure-transit-manifest.json}
 171: - photosphere: \path{native-atmosphere-reconstruction-manifest.json}
 172: - pair-channel and instantaneous-response arithmetic: \path{notes/REQUEST284_*}
 173: 
 174: \path{notes/REQUEST285_*} maps each result to its inputs, scripts and outputs. The later steps read runtime arrays of the endpoint run, which are listed by hash in \path{native-quad-refined-primary-manifest.json} but not deposited, so those steps cannot be re-run from the deposit alone. \path{verification/verify_unified_paper.py} does not check Section 4.6.
 175: 
 176: **References:** restore \texttt{kaplan2014j0337}, \texttt{ransom2014triple} and \texttt{bertotti2003cassini} as in commit a322c6462.
 177: 
