 413: 
 414: **Imported from prior work.** The registered-grid causal maximum is \(\max|z|=2.2851\), with simulation-based global p=0.26. The advanced comparison gives 2.3398 and p=0.282. The stored detection flag is false under the registered rule. These probabilities refer to the recorded Gaussian-noise simulations, nuisance space and finite grid; they are not an independent validation of the noise model.
